{"id":932,"profile":{"ID":985,"title":"Chris Duffey","content":"","attr_title":"","menu_type":"profile","url":"\/profile\/chris-duffey\/","slug":"chris-duffey","parent":"969","coords":"","offset":"","confirmation_status":"","event_length_seconds":"","point_of_contact":"","guest_type":"","event_type":"","appearance_type":"","notes":"","classes":[""],"post":{"ID":932,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2021-09-09 04:07:48","post_date_gmt":"2021-09-09 04:07:48","post_content":"\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChris Duffey spearheads Adobe\u2019s Creative Cloud strategic development experience design partnerships across the creative enterprise space. Chris\u2019 keynotes have received over 50 million impressions. His sessions have been reported around the world including Access Hollywood, Extra, Ok Magazine, Hello, People, and The Guardian. In addition, his work has been featured by more than 100 global media outlets on topics including generative experience design, computational creativity, the role of human and machine and AI enhanced creativity.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrior to Adobe, Chris was an Executive Creative Director having been a creative consultant with over 35 advertising agencies across the major global holding companies: WPP, IPG, Havas, Omnicom, Publicis and MDC.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChris also serves on The Board of Directors for the Association of National Advertisers NY (ANA) and The Consumer Technology Association (CTA) Board of Industry Leaders.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChris is author of the award-winning book Superhuman Innovation, the world\u2019s first book co-authored by AI about AI.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E","post_title":"Chris Duffey","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_s